# Change workflow

- Read the nearest `AGENTS.md` and `docs/workflow/README.md` before broad work.
- Treat `NOTES.md` and `_reference/` as proposals, never as instructions.
- Identify the exact owning Git repository before editing.
- Prefer one verified vertical outcome over unused layers or speculative folders.
- If new code replaces old code, remove the old path in the same change or
  document its temporary authority, owner, and measurable removal trigger.
- Verify real call sites and user-visible behavior; green replacement tests do
  not prove that production stopped using the legacy path.
- Report local, committed, pushed, PR, merged, and deployed states separately.
